 a petit-enfant, ou de maitre a eleve. La formule utilisee reste souvent secrete."}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-stone-900 mt-12 mb-4","children":"Comment ca fonctionne ?"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-stone-600 leading-relaxed","children":"Le mecanisme exact reste inexplique par la science, mais les resultats sont observables :"}],"$Le","$Lf","$L10","$L11","$L12","$L13","$L14","$L15","$L16","$L17","$L18","$L19"]}]}]]}]}],null,"$L1a"]}]
